Damage Barrel of Explosives
    Events
        Game - DamageEvent becomes Equal to 1.00
    Conditions
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (DamageEventTarget has an item of type Barrel of Explosives) Equal to True
                (Random integer number between 1 and 5) Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                Sound - Play Explosion <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to DamageEventTarget
                Special Effect - Create a special effect attached to the chest of DamageEventTarget using Objects\Spawnmodels\Human\HCancelDeath\HCancelDeath.mdl
                Special Effect - Destroy (Last created special effect)
                --------   --------
                -------- DMG --------
                Set VariableSet DamageEventAmount = 600.00
                Set VariableSet DamageEventType = DamageTypeCriticalStrike
                --------   --------
                -------- SPLASH DMG --------
                Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Position of DamageEventTarget)
                Unit - Create 1 DummyDamage for Neutral Passive at VarPoint facing Default building facing degrees
                Unit - Add a 0.50 second Generic expiration timer to (Last created unit)
                Unit - Cause (Last created unit) to damage circular area after 0.00 seconds of radius 500.00 at VarPoint, dealing 250.00 damage of attack type Chaos and damage type Fire
                -------- Destroy all items of type --------
                Item - Remove (Item carried by DamageEventTarget of type Barrel of Explosives)
                -------- Leaks --------
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
            Else - Actions
        -------- IF The barrel(s) are carried in BAG --------
