                        Unit - Add a 0.50 second Generic expiration timer to (Last created unit)
                        Unit - Cause (Last created unit) to damage circular area after 0.00 seconds of radius 500.00 at VarPoint, dealing 250.00 damage of attack type Chaos and damage type Fire
                        -------- Destroy all items of type --------
                        Item - Remove (Item carried by (Picked unit) of type Barrel of Explosives)
